EXPECT_HAS | h/&.hq-apps/plus-phone/instances/1/.hq_manager/ui.txt | No conversations yet | and-the-hint-says-what-to-do
EXPECT_HAS | h/&.hq-apps/plus-phone/instances/1/.hq_manager/ui.txt | show_top=0 | no-input-field-on-the-threads-view-(top)
EXPECT_HAS | h/&.hq-apps/plus-phone/instances/1/.hq_manager/ui.txt | show_bot=0 | nor-at-the-bottom
EXPECT_HAS | h/&.hq-apps/plus-phone/instances/1/.hq_manager/ui.txt | cls_threads=dimbtn | the-active-tab-is-dimmed

