RUN | $T/h/&.hq-apps/plus-phone/apps/texting/ops/+x/texting_op.+x | ui_cmd | $T/h/&.hq-apps/plus-phone/instances/1 | $T/h/&.hq-apps/plus-phone/instances/1 | $T/h | hello bot
EXPECT_HAS | h/&.hq-apps/plus-phone/instances/1/.hq_manager/last.txt | sent | the-send-says-sent
EXPECT_HAS | h/xyzfs/users/u1/home/livedesk/pals/cursword/inventory/self/inventory/zz.phone/outbox.txt | hello bot | it-is-in-MY-outbox
